{"gems":{"name":"solid_queue-listen_notify","downloads":210,"version":"0.5.1","version_created_at":"2026-07-28T05:19:36.250Z","version_downloads":52,"platform":"ruby","authors":"Carl Mercier","info":"A database trigger notifies Solid Queue workers the moment a job becomes ready, so jobs start in milliseconds even with polling intervals raised to seconds or minutes — which cuts the idle query load that polling generates by orders of magnitude. No monkey patches: the gem wires itself in through Solid Queue's documented lifecycle hooks. Polling remains the correctness backstop, and every failure mode — missing trigger, non-Postgres adapter, PgBouncer, a dropped connection, a fork — degrades loudly to stock Solid Queue behavior.","licenses":["MIT"],"metadata":{"homepage_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify","changelog_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify/issues","source_code_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify","documentation_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify/blob/main/README.md","rubygems_mfa_required":"true"},"yanked":false,"sha":"3760b87f5dcc559a2ca0609565d011783656558cec816db057876f1bb7e72e8e","spec_sha":"47530a349967dd534883db6d68a986214f4b54ec4630ce56996d5c298a34c47d","project_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/solid_queue-listen_notify","gem_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/solid_queue-listen_notify-0.5.1.gem","homepage_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify","wiki_uri":null,"documentation_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify/blob/main/README.md","mailing_list_uri":null,"source_code_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify/issues","changelog_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md","funding_uri":null,"dependencies":{"development":[],"runtim